  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这里放着一个花盆……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 0D 04}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}咦？\n这个花盆里……发芽了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那是爱情的萌芽……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 04 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 18 07}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}小雪！\n你和小熊的爱情，到了收获季节熊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 06 01 05 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这样啊。\n原来已经到了收割熊毛的季节。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 0A 01 0B 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 71 07}{F5 C1 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}呀啊！\n别把小熊剃光光啊！\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F4 87 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 86 05 01 03 01 06 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 E1 03}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}真是的，小熊这家伙……\n动不动就去招惹别人……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}不过，这随手招惹的代价，\n恐怕可没那么轻巧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 07 01 01 01 01 01 F5 02}{F5 86 07 01 0D 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那个！\n这盆花，应该一直\n没人给它浇水吧？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 07 01 07 01 65 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不会枯掉吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 04 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A2 02}对哦，说得也是。\n要是我们能给它浇水就好了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，不先找到\n能浇水的东西，就没办法吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞这里放着一个花盆……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e711_370.bf.json:9:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_009",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞在地图上记下这里，\n　等拿到能浇水的东西后，\n　再回来吧……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 }
